# No seed imagery is stored here. An abandoned attempt pointed every category
# at /uploads/seed/cat-*.svg and never generated the files, so the storefront
# rendered thirteen broken tiles that re-seeding could not heal. Seed photos
# are external URLs now, pinned and eyeballed in scripts/seedImages.js.


